---
import List from "#/components/ui/List.astro";
import Paragraph from "#/components/ui/Paragraph.astro";
import Section from "#/components/ui/Section.astro";
import Heading from "#/components/ui/Heading.astro";
import IconText from "#/components/ui/IconText.astro";
import Card from "#/components/ui/Card.astro";
import Content from "#/components/ui/Content.astro";
import Highlight from "#/components/ui/Highlight.astro";
---

<Section headingId="butWhatAboutPrivacyHeading" descriptionId="butWhatAboutPrivacyDescription" variant="light">
    <Content slot="text" classes="gap-6 sm:gap-15 xl:flex-row xl:gap-5 xl:pb-8 2xl:gap-25">
        <div class="2xl:w-unset flex flex-col gap-3 xl:mt-12 xl:w-[45%] xl:pt-2">
            <Heading id="butWhatAboutPrivacyHeading">
                But what about <Highlight color="text-bubblegum-pink">privacy?</Highlight>
            </Heading>
            <Paragraph id="butWhatAboutPrivacyDescription">
                The bot keeps just enough recent chat to make memes, such as the messages themselves and links to
                attachments like GIFs, but not who sent them. This data gets automatically purged on schedule, but you
                can also remove it at any moment in <b>/settings</b>
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph>
                Oh, and Jstmemit is turned off everywhere by default and needs to be enabled per channel using <b
                    >/enable</b
                >
            </Paragraph>

            <List classes="justify-center md:justify-start">
                <IconText
                    icon="https://files.jstmemit.com/jstmemit/images/emojis/gif.svg"
                    alt="gif logo icon"
                    text="GIFs: 90 days"
                />
                <IconText
                    icon="https://files.jstmemit.com/jstmemit/images/emojis/chats.svg"
                    alt="texts icon"
                    text="Texts: 30 days"
                />
                <IconText
                    icon="https://files.jstmemit.com/jstmemit/images/emojis/image.svg"
                    alt="image icon"
                    text="Images: 1 day"
                />
            </List>
        </div>

        <div>
            <ul class="relative flex flex-col gap-10 sm:min-h-95 md:min-h-115 xl:min-h-95">
                <li class="mb-1 font-bold whitespace-nowrap sm:absolute sm:top-10 sm:left-105 lg:text-lg">
                    <p>Your message<br class="hidden sm:block" /> in Discord</p>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <Card classes="p-4 pt-5 max-w-full sm:max-w-fit" label="Discord">
                        <img
                            class="h-22.5 w-auto sm:h-auto sm:w-90"
                            src="https://jstmemit.com/cdn-cgi/image/format=avif,fit=scale-down,metadata=none,sharpen=1,onerror=redirect,quality=40,slow-connection-quality=30,width=700/https://files.jstmemit.com/jstmemit/images/cocaColaBetterThanPepsi.png"
                            alt="A discord message saying that cola is better than pepsi, has an avatar, username, tag"
                        />
                    </Card>
                </li>

                <li class="absolute top-40 left-10 z-10 hidden min-w-50 sm:block lg:left-23">
                    <img
                        src="https://files.jstmemit.com/jstmemit/images/arrowBent.svg"
                        alt="pink arrow"
                        aria-hidden="true"
                    />
                </li>

                <li class="mb-1 font-bold whitespace-nowrap sm:absolute sm:top-70 sm:left-0 lg:left-5 lg:text-lg">
                    <p>Anonymous text<br class="hidden sm:block" /> content for memes</p>
                </li>

                <li class="sm:absolute sm:top-49 sm:left-40 lg:left-55">
                    <Card classes="p-4 pt-5" label="Stored">
                        <pre
                            class="min-h-auto font-mono text-xs sm:w-auto sm:text-sm">
<span class="text-golden">{`{`}</span>
    <span class="text-hot-fuchsia">[</span>
        <span class="text-dark-cyan">"<span class="text-white">Coca cola is better than pepsi</span>"</span>,
        <span class="text-dark-cyan">"<span class="text-white">and fanta</span>"</span>
    <span class="text-hot-fuchsia">]</span>
<span class="text-golden">{`}`}</span></pre>
                    </Card>
                    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 mr-4 text-center font-medium sm:hidden">
                        Used for memes in <br class="hidden sm:block" />the same channel
                    </p>
                </li>

                <li
                    class="absolute top-98 left-90 -mt-3 hidden w-full font-bold whitespace-nowrap sm:block lg:left-100 lg:text-lg"
                >
                    <p>Used for memes in <br />the same channel</p>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </Content>
</Section>
